    "description": "Version 1.0 \u2014 2026-08-01. ACRP-07: applies the adelic valuation kernel (valuation \u2192 tree boundary \u2192 Ostrowski \u2192 adeles) to the Qubit Delusion thesis (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21254143). The K3 audit (ACRP-01, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21727314) found the Qubit Delusion makes NO explicit kernel use. This paper examines three candidate junctions \u2014 particle-ontology critique, error-correction overhead wall, substrate-is-algorithm thesis \u2014 and finds the kernel is aesthetic, not load-bearing, at all three. Registers four dated, strength-weighted calibration predictions. Part of the Adelic Core Research Program.",
